The '''Skylands''' are a group of cloud-based islands located in the [[First Sea]]. They begin at sea level like other islands but gradually rise into the sky. Most areas are accessible without [[flight]], as the islands are connected by small bridges.

==Appearance==

===First Island===
The first island of the Skylands is a crescent-shaped, grounded island. The island is mostly covered in grass and is dotted with rocks. When the player goes at the back side of the first or the base island, they will find two big rocks and one of the two rocks has the [[Mad Scientist]], who sells the [[Electric]] fighting style. There is also a small lake, supplied by a waterfall from higher islands.

In the lake there is also a mini wharf with 3 NPC’s: [[Angler (NPC)|Angler]], [[Luxury Boat Dealer]], [[Boat Dealer]].

===Second Island===
[[File:NewSkybandit.PNG|thumb|<center>Sky Bandits Area]]
The second island of the Skylands is the first island to be on a cloud and above sea level. It has [[Sky Bandit]]s on it, along with a large temple near the back of the island. On top of the temple is [[Yoshi]], who sells the [[Tomoe Ring]]. The island is entirely devoid of grass.

===Third Island===
The third island of the Skylands is also the smallest, being a tiny area with six trees and four [[Dark Master]]s. The island is covered with grass and some trees, and there is a large, flat-shaped rock on the side of the island.

===Fourth Island===
The fourth island of the Skylands features the most [[NPCs]] out of all of them. It includes the [[Sky Adventurer]] ([[Quests|Quest Giver]]), the [[Set Home Point]], and the [[Master Sword Dealer]]. This island is covered with grass and trees, has paths, and features numerous houses. It also has a waterfall flowing down to the first island. There is a building with a door that can be destroyed by [[Dark Blade]] Z, which has one of the three [[The Son Quest|Love Letters]] in it. Behind a yellow house is the [[Angel Guard]].

