== Secret Quests ==

* Upon entering the island by docks, turn 90 degrees left, to the [[Mad Scientist]]. They will ask the player for a [[Lightning Bolt]]. To find a Lightning Bolt, climb up the island and find a cloud that flashes dark gray. Break the flashing cloud with any attack and the player will get the Lightning Bolt. Return to the Mad Scientist and give him the Lightning Bolt.
* After waiting an unspecified amount of time on Lower Skylands, the game message, "Sky Bandits have invaded the Sky Castle" will appear. Go to the castle, break through the large brown roof piece, defeat the enemies, pick up the paper near the entrance, and use the code on the vault in the castle’s center.
* After an unspecified amount of time on Lower Skylands, a yellow cloud will start flying around the islands. If the player passes through it or attacks it, a chest will fall. Repeat that 3 times to drop a diamond chest, find and interact with the chest. This will spawn a group of enemies the player needs to kill, the final one will give the player a key to open the chest.

==Upper Skylands==
To access the Upper Skylands, it is recommended to jump on the tallest tree near the island, then air jump 7-9 times and use dashes to get to the island (or just use a flight move) containing the temple that teleports to this location. The upper part of the Skylands, nicknamed the '[[Upper Skylands]]', has areas that are so massive that there is a separate page for it, accessible [[Upper Skylands|here]].

==Trivia==
* The Skylands are a group of islands with the second highest amount of separate landmasses, beaten out only by the [[Sea of Treats]], which has five islands.
* Since [[Updates/17.2|Update 17.2]], the Skylands (excluding the [[Upper Skylands]]) now connect with each other with bridges. The player no longer needs to [[Flight|Fly]] or [[Air Jump]] up there.
* It is recommended to skip the [[Sky Bandit]]s quest by server hopping [[Vice Admiral]] at [[Marine Fortress]].
* Until [[Updates/24|Update 24]], the player could fly through [[Hoops]] to change their appearance if they were using the [[Dragon (Classic)]] fruit.

